{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Decision 463: \"is empty\" is \"not truthy\" — a value that doesn't exist, or is empty, is not truthy, and the value\nanswers for itself. The os bot's report: %event.guest% on {\"mouse\": …} said not empty, silently.",
